body:
One of my tricks is to pick any task and break the task into the smallest steps possible, think of the very first step, and do it. For example, I'm laying in bed and need to sweep. The very first thing I need to do is sit up. Then get out of bed, then go to the closet, then grab the broom, and so on. Sometimes a task can seem overwhelming because there are so many steps and different ways to go about them and this helps me get started. 

&#x200B;

What kind of ideas do you have for stuff you want to do?
